Iridium 1.0.35 - Price in Rubles & UX Improvements

💰 Tariffs:
- Price now in rubles (stars = rub × 1.5 auto)
- Display shows both: 100₽ (150⭐)

🎁 Promo defaults unified:
- Empty input = default value
- No more "enter 0 for never"

✨ Input validation:
- Retry invalid fields instead of restarting
- Better error messages for each field
